WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Let us pay close attention to this gesture.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.720
The boy will present the bread to the
priest,

3
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.700
offering this bread, and the girl will say:

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Lord, we offer You this bread,

5
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.940
together with the work of our parents.

6
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:26.260
You teach us that we can nourish the lives
of our brothers and sisters

7
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:30.000
and be true missionaries in building Your
kingdom.

8
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.660
Blessed be God forever. Everyone:

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.300
Blessed be God forever.

10
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.000
Wine.

11
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.060
We offer You this wine, Lord,

12
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.200
a symbol of our joy and effort.

13
00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:50.900
May we find happiness in our life’s journey.

14
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.820
[The remaining words are unclear.]

15
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:58.520
Blessed be God forever.

16
00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.340
Everyone else, stay seated.

17
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:10.560
Let us sing and join the children’s choir.
